WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,240
I also want to earn some extra money from the agency and let others earn it.

2
00:00:02,240 --> 00:00:03,280
Might as well let me earn

3
00:00:03,280 --> 00:00:04,480
I will definitely buy it at the lowest price

4
00:00:04,480 --> 00:00:06,000
You will definitely be satisfied

5
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:07,080
Then you do it

6
00:00:07,080 --> 00:00:07,990
Thank you boss

7
00:00:07,990 --> 00:00:09,070
You two do something for me

8
00:00:09,070 --> 00:00:09,990
Can't do it without a car

9
00:00:09,990 --> 00:00:11,150
Give you beauties a car

10
00:00:11,150 --> 00:00:12,070
You pick it out yourself.

11
00:00:12,070 --> 00:00:13,650
Direct results within one million

12
00:00:13,650 --> 00:00:16,490
This treatment is so cool, boss, what about you?

13
00:00:16,490 --> 00:00:18,050
Do you want me to customize a luxury car for you?

14
00:00:18,050 --> 00:00:19,210
Just buy me a four-wheeler

15
00:00:19,210 --> 00:00:20,910
As long as it can be loaded

16
00:00:20,910 --> 00:00:21,910
You are such a big boss

17
00:00:21,910 --> 00:00:23,110
Driving a four-wheel pickup truck

18
00:00:23,110 --> 00:00:24,550
A four-wheeler is a work vehicle

19
00:00:24,550 --> 00:00:26,670
To carry stones and wool, my arrest car

20
00:00:26,670 --> 00:00:29,350
Let me talk about the company clerk and front desk when I come back from Changbai Mountain

21
00:00:29,350 --> 00:00:30,390
Don’t have to look too much

22
00:00:30,390 --> 00:00:31,630
Seven or eight are enough

23
00:00:31,630 --> 00:00:32,950
The monthly salary is 30,000 to 50,000 yuan

24
00:00:32,950 --> 00:00:35,430
Must have a good image and be able to do things well

25
00:00:35,430 --> 00:00:36,950
Please send the recruitment advertisement as soon as possible

26
00:00:36,950 --> 00:00:40,320
Guaranteed completion of tasks

27
00:00:40,320 --> 00:00:41,680
Brother Zhang

28
00:00:41,680 --> 00:00:43,800
That Miss Fan from Qianbao Group

29
00:00:43,800 --> 00:00:46,160
Is she your girlfriend? No

30
00:00:46,160 --> 00:00:47,720
I've only known her for two days

31
00:00:47,720 --> 00:00:51,280
We only met each other when we were selling doghead flowers. Oh, so that’s how it is.
